{"id":"brouillard","lemma":"brouillard","pos":"noun","rank":3481,"glosses":["fog, mist","daybook"],"ipa":"/bʁu.jaʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/30/Fr-brouillard.ogg/Fr-brouillard.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"brouillards"},"formAudio":{"brouillards":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-brouillards.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le brouillard est très dense.","en":"The fog's very dense.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102846","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},{"g":"dense"}]},{"text":"Nous nous égarâmes dans le brouillard.","en":"We got lost in the fog.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"we / us"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Il y a souvent du brouillard le matin.","en":"There is often fog in the morning.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"often"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"morning"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"ago"]]},{"text":"Je ne pouvais voir que du brouillard.","en":"I could see nothing but fog.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Le brouillard s'épaissit.","en":"The fog is getting thicker.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to thicken","l":"épaissir"}]}]}